+
+namespace safarium {
+
+// Chrome's content-setting bubble (pop-ups blocked, camera in use, location
+// blocked…) as a native popover under `anchor`, the indicator in the
+// address field. Owns `model` while open and commits its choice when it
+// closes, as Chrome's own bubble does; then runs `on_close`. Opening another
+// one closes this one.
